        <article class="info-card-white apple-legal-doc">
            <section id="privacy-collect" class="legal-section">
                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>When you create an account, book a stay, or host on Stayora, we may collect:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Account details such as your name, email address, phone number, and profile photo.</li>
                    <li>Authentication information including encrypted passwords or Google OAuth identifiers.</li>
                    <li>Booking details, property listings, room information, and verified guest reviews you submit.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="privacy-use" class="legal-section">
                <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>To create and secure your account, including OTP verification and password resets.</li>
                    <li>To process room bookings and connect guests with verified hosts.</li>
                    <li>To improve search speed, display accurate property listings, and prevent fraud or spam.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="privacy-cookies" class="legal-section">
                <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Sessions</h2>
                <p>
                    Stayora uses secure HTTP-only session cookies with <code>SameSite=Lax</code> protection to keep you signed in and protect your account against unauthorized cross-site requests. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="privacy-security" class="legal-section">
                <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
                <p>
                    We protect passwords using industry-standard hashing (bcrypt), enforce rate limiting on sensitive routes, validate origin headers and CSRF tokens on state-changing requests, and store sessions securely in Redis.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="privacy-rights" class="legal-section">
                <h2>5. Your Rights &amp; Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    You may request updates or deletion of your account information at any time by contacting us at
                    <a class="apple-inline-link" href="mailto:support@bookstayora.in">support@bookstayora.in</a> or calling
                    <a class="apple-inline-link" href="tel:+919212684600">+91 92126 84600</a>.
                </p>
            </section>
